%% The answer agent, slice A (9.0): tool turns, then a JSON answer that code checks before anyone sees it.
flowchart LR
  Q["Question<br/>+ product scope"]:::human --> T1["Model turn<br/>picks tools<br/>(Haiku 5.5, thinking on)"]:::ext
  T1 --> TOOLS["7 read-only tools<br/>13 Cypher queries<br/>in FalkorDB"]:::store
  TOOLS --> TN["Next model turns<br/>read results, call more<br/>at most 8 calls"]:::ext
  TN --> J["Final turn<br/>JSON answer:<br/>text + [n] citations"]:::ext
  J --> V{"Validator in code<br/>1 cited id came from a tool<br/>2 quote is word for word<br/>3 every sentence cited"}:::guard
  V -->|passes| A["Answer with<br/>verified citations"]:::file
  V -->|fails| R["One repair turn<br/>problems listed"]:::ext
  R --> C["Clean-up in code<br/>drop what still fails"]:::guard
  C -->|something cited is left| A
  C -->|nothing left| N["Abstain:<br/>Not found in Lore's graph"]:::file
